`Scheduled tasks: schtasks /create executions (Sysmon 1). Check the parent process and the task name in the command line.`
index=sysmon sourcetype="*WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| search Image="*schtasks.exe" CommandLine="*/create*"
| table _time, host, User, ParentImage, CommandLine
